% layout 'default';
% title 'FAQ';

<div class="container" style="margin: 60px auto; max-width: 900px;">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">How can I track my order?</h3>
    <p>Open your order details page and check the tracking number shown for your order.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">Can I cancel my order?</h3>
    <p>Orders can be cancelled before shipping. Contact support with your order ID.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">Do you provide invoice?</h3>
    <p>Yes, GST-ready invoices are available from the order details page.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">Which payment methods are supported?</h3>
    <p>Card, UPI, Net Banking, PayPal, and Cash on Delivery (where applicable).</p>
</div>
